      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name}: Sure. Not all world creators are saints, im giving the benefit of the doubt and assuming most are acting in good faith. I sure am!\n\nRemoving any feature that can be good because of a small \"bad\" minority should not, and in my opinion will never happen.\n\nSee: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/disable-group-instance-ability-to-kick-world-authors",
      "viewerReactions": null,
