      "value": "@{5aa9533aa739da06e6018df6|full_name}: Who is \"instance master\" doesn't have anything to do with moderation.\n\nI was just trying to figure out what type of instance @{5fb74ac83473b36c24d37c12|full_name} was in when this happened to them. But as I have made clear, I see no issue with an instance owner kicking a world's creator. Especially if the instance in question was a private instance.",
